 "note": "HRA 3D Reference Organs, female (united-female v1.5) as the female model; read by scripts/build-female.mjs. names: the whole English name of a part (by id); baseNames: the name without its side (by id without _L/_R; the side comes from the id). Names follow BodyParts3D so app/names.zh-TW.json translates them. swapSides: ids whose left and right are the wrong way round in the source (the Allen brain: its _L parts lie on the right of the body). midline: structures the source cuts into halves, named once without a side. systems: by id or /pattern/, before the body model's system for the same name; systemRules: after it. groups: names of the source's search groups by id (null leaves one out); extraGroups add groups by a part id pattern. centre: the spine goes on x = 0 and the middle of the skin's depth on z = 0.",
